\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Milestone
\f1\b0 : The TPlus platform is entering Target Population Dose-Ranging Trials. Phase I (healthy volunteer safety and acute toxicology trials) is fully complete, and the safety data is locked. Phase IIa is focused on proving early efficacy.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Corporate Pitch
\f1\b0 : Dr Hamish Hermann uses the Phase I safety locks and early Phase IIa efficacy data to pitch the project's financial viability to the board to unlock massive funding for a Phase III production rollout. The drug remains completely unreleased and months or years away from public availability.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The "Two-Week" Corporate Data
\f1\b0 : Official corporate data trends show that a standard injected dose provides a massive panacea effect that vanishes after a few weeks. The corporate pitch proudly frames this short window not as a product failure, but as a deliberate 
\f2\b Designed Half-Life
\f1\b0 \'97built-in digital rights management (DRM) for human biology to secure the subscription business model.\
