\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Assumption
\f1\b0 : According to Dr Hermann\'92s mathematical models, permanent, self-sustaining integration of the TPlus virus into a host genome is a statistically negligible absurdity.\
\ls6\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Defense Model
\f1\b0 : Hermann's data states that any viral concentration high enough to force chromosomal integration will trigger an immediate, terminal cellular checkpoint, causing immediate systemic toxic shock, catastrophic anaphylaxis, and liquefied kidneys within minutes. He believes the biological engine fails entirely long before chromosomal integration can occur, ensuring the subscription model remains un-hackable.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa265\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs32 The Target Pathology & The Theft\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Target
\f1\b0 : Janine's daughter, Sarah, coincidentally suffers from Limb-Girdle Muscular Dystrophy (LGMD).\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Risk
\f1\b0 : Janine, working on the trials, realizes Hermann's defense models only account for healthy, stable cell tissue. LGMD muscle tissue is plagued by constant mechanical stress, leaving it riddled with continuous 
\f2\b Double-Strand DNA Breaks (DSBs)
\f1\b0 .\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Theft
\f1\b0 : Because the laboratory is actively running Phase IIa protocols, Janine has direct access to high-concentration operational batches meant for localized tissue trials. She siphons these specific vials off in parallel, tracking the trial data at work to adjust her secret treatments at home.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Execution & Result
\f1\b0 : Janine administers high-concentration intramuscular injections directly into Sarah's wasting limb muscles. Because Sarah\'92s DNA is fractured like a broken zipper, her cells are frantically trying to glue themselves back together.\
\ls7\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 NHEJ-Mediated Chromosomal Splicing
\f1\b0 : The localized "giga-dose" saturates the muscle tissue. Sarah\'92s panicked cellular repair machinery uses 
\f2\b Non-Homologous End Joining (NHEJ)
\f1\b0  to repair the broken chromosomes. The cells mistake the floating TPlus viral DNA for spare parts and "sew" the virus directly into the wounds of her chromosomes to stop themselves from dying. This bypasses the mitotic requirement entirely and prevents the systemic, lethal anaphylaxis Hermann predicted. Sarah is cured permanently, her 160-year lifespan upgrade is self-sustaining, and her appearance is often described as \'93invincible\'94.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
