\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Logic
\f1\b0 : In adulthood, Sarah comes to understand that being cured of LGMD has biologically modified her to near supernatural health. She notices sex partners being rejuvenated. Their increasing demands on her earn conflict, desperation, and criminal charges. This forces her to recoil from intimate relationships entirely. Her self-imposed isolation keeps her hidden from the world and from Hardy. She eventually confesses to Chanta.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa265\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs32 Jamison Hardy\'92s Economic Threat Assessment\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls9\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Threat
\f1\b0 : Hardy sends a minion to investigate the TPlus project. Upon receiving the technical brief, he balances the immense humanitarian potential against the global economic reality. A universal panacea that grants a 160-year lifespan of pristine health would trigger a structural apocalypse: the total collapse of the private medical, pharmaceutical, and health insurance sectors, followed by the instant bankruptcy of global pension systems and real estate markets due to the loss of generational turnover.\
\ls9\ilvl0
\f2\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 The Action
\f1\b0 : Hardy decides the discovery is a systemic bomb that must be silenced. He orders the facility in the Pale to be permanently frozen and sealed under a hard security lockdown.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa265\partightenfactor0

\f3 \cf0 \strokec2 <$Scr_H::2>
\f2\b\fs32 Hardy\'92s Blindspot\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\b0\fs24 \cf0 \strokec2 <!$Scr_H::2>
\f1 \
\pard\tx220\tx720\pardeftab720\li720\fi-720\partightenfactor0
\ls10\ilvl0
\f2\b \cf0 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
