\f1\b0 : Hardy calculates that the base TPlus platform is a leaky, unprofitable hazard because of its fluid-transmission potential. He seals the labs and shuts down his medical research, confident that he has completely buried the threat to his financial empire. He has no reason to look for Sarah, and her isolation ensures she stays off his radar. He has no idea that the virus has already escaped his leash, and that the only permanent, self-sustaining carrier on Earth is a young girl sitting completely alone in a house outside the sealed gates.\
